{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"Unsuspecting: a past life story","html":"<article id='ja76'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Jātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Stories of Past Lives 76 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Varuṇavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Warding Tree </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>6. Asaṅkiyajātaka </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Unsuspecting: a past life story </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Asaṅkiyomhi gāmamhi, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>I am unsuspecting in the village; </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>araññe natthi me bhayaṁ; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>in the wilderness there’s no peril for me: </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Ujuṁ maggaṁ samārūḷho, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>I ride upon the straight path </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>mettāya karuṇāya cā”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>with love and compassion. </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>Asaṅkiyajātakaṁ chaṭṭhaṁ. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
